From 0488a5b14f8f0c8115269bbc1e94798c12c1a045 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] lotus_v2: enforce mandatory NULLFAIL and add
 BatchSigCollector Schnorr batch verification

Enforce mandatory NULLFAIL on failed CHECKSIG/CHECKMULTISIG operations
in the V2 VM and add BatchSigCollector for deferred Schnorr batch
verification across multi-transaction validation batches.
